<%- include('partials/landingPageHeader') %>
<!-- xxx Header End xxx -->
 <style>
   .property-page {
     background: #f6f4ef;
     color: #1d2927;
     font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
     padding: 76px 0 96px;
   }

   .property-shell {
     max-width: 1180px;
     margin: 0 auto;
     padding: 0 24px;
   }

   .property-intro {
     display: flex;
     justify-content: space-between;
     gap: 32px;
     align-items: end;
     margin-bottom: 44px;
   }

   .property-kicker {
     color: #b26935;
     font: 700 12px/1.2 Arial, sans-serif;
     letter-spacing: 2px;
     text-transform: uppercase;
   }

   .property-intro h1 {
     font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 68px);
     font-weight: 400;
     line-height: .98;
     margin: 14px 0 16px;
     max-width: 650px;
   }

   .property-intro p {
     color: #68716d;
     font: 16px/1.7 Arial, sans-serif;
     max-width: 510px;
     margin: 0;
   }

   .property-count {
     color: #68716d;
     font: 13px Arial, sans-serif;
     white-space: nowrap;
   }

   .property-grid {
     display: grid;
     grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
     gap: 24px;
   }

   .property-card {
     background: #fff;
     box-shadow: 0 12px 34px rgba(29, 41, 39, .08);
     transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
   }

   .property-card:hover {
     transform: translateY(-6px);
     box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(29, 41, 39, .14);
   }

   .property-card-image {
     height: 260px;
     position: relative;
     overflow: hidden;
   }

   .property-card-image img {
     width: 100%;
     height: 100%;
     object-fit: cover;
     transition: transform .5s ease;
   }

   .property-card:hover img {
     transform: scale(1.04);
   }

   .property-status {
     background: #e9b178;
     color: #1d2927;
     font: 700 11px Arial, sans-serif;
     letter-spacing: 1px;
     padding: 8px 11px;
     position: absolute;
     left: 16px;
     top: 16px;
     text-transform: uppercase;
   }

   .property-card-copy {
     padding: 24px 24px 26px;
   }

   .property-card-copy h2 {
     font-size: 28px;
     font-weight: 400;
     margin: 0 0 6px;
   }

   .property-type,
   .property-location {
     color: #68716d;
     font: 13px Arial, sans-serif;
   }

   .property-location {
     margin: 0 0 22px;
   }

   .property-card-copy p {
     color: #52605b;
     font: 14px/1.65 Arial, sans-serif;
     min-height: 68px;
     margin: 0 0 20px;
   }

   .property-meta {
     border-top: 1px solid #e5e5df;
     border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5df;
     display: flex;
     gap: 14px;
     padding: 14px 0;
     color: #52605b;
     font: 12px Arial, sans-serif;
   }

   .property-price {
     color: #1d2927;
     font: 700 21px Georgia, serif;
     margin: 20px 0;
   }

   .property-link {
     color: #b26935;
     font: 700 12px Arial, sans-serif;
     letter-spacing: 1.2px;
     text-decoration: none;
     text-transform: uppercase;
   }

   .property-link:hover {
     color: #1d2927;
   }

   @media (max-width: 900px) {
     .property-grid {
       grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
     }
   }

   @media (max-width: 620px) {
     .property-page {
       padding: 52px 0 70px;
     }

     .property-intro {
       display: block;
     }

     .property-count {
       display: block;
       margin-top: 22px;
     }

     .property-grid {
       grid-template-columns: 1fr;
     }
   }
 </style>

<div id="body-content">
  <div class="container" style="margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <div class="row pad-top">

      <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
        <div class="sidebar-padding">
          <div class="">
            <h1>Real Estate</h1>
            <!-- <p><img src="/assets/home/images/real-estate.jpg" alt="Polaris Finance - Real Estate Investing"></p> -->
            <div class="small-sep">&nbsp;</div>

            <div class="lead mb-4">
              At Polaris Finance, we make real estate investing more accessible through fractional ownership, carefully selected REITs, and curated property portfolios. We help our clients unlock one of the most reliable asset classes for building lasting, multi-generational wealth.
            </div>

            <p>Real estate offers steady rental income (cash flow), long-term property appreciation, the power of leverage through financing, and meaningful tax advantages — including depreciation deductions, mortgage interest deductibility, and 1031 exchanges. It also serves as a strong hedge against inflation, as rents and property values typically rise with the cost of living.</p>

            <p>Beyond pure financial returns, real estate provides tangible assets with intrinsic value, valuable portfolio diversification (low correlation with equities), and a greater sense of control. Many of our clients use it to create reliable passive income streams and build equity that supports retirement goals and generational wealth transfer.</p>

            <p>With Polaris Finance, you benefit from expert curation, rigorous due diligence, and a streamlined digital experience that removes the traditional complexity of direct property ownership.</p>

            <div class="small-sep">&nbsp;</div>

            <h3>Why invest in Real Estate with Polaris?</h3>
            <p>Our thesis is simple: real estate remains one of the most proven vehicles for wealth creation when approached with discipline and professional management. We focus on high-quality, income-producing assets and structures that prioritize capital preservation alongside attractive risk-adjusted returns.</p>

            <h4>Key risks to consider</h4>
            <ul>
              <li>Property values can fluctuate with economic cycles</li>
              <li>Vacancy rates and operating costs may vary</li>
              <li>Liquidity windows typically range from 30–90 days</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="small-sep">&nbsp;</div>

            <h3>How to Invest</h3>
            <p><strong>From onboarding to allocation in minutes</strong></p>

            <ol>
              <li>
                <strong>Open your account</strong><br>
                Complete identity verification and securely link your funding source.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Choose your allocation</strong><br>
                Select the target percentage you wish to allocate to the Real Estate sleeve within your broader portfolio.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Track performance</strong><br>
                Monitor distributions, net asset value, and overall returns in real time through your Polaris dashboard.
              </li>
            </ol>

            <div class="small-sep">&nbsp;</div>

            <p class="lead">Ready to grow your wealth with Polaris Finance?</p>
            <p>Join investors who are building diversified portfolios across high-performing sectors — starting with real estate.</p>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="property-shell" style="margin-bottom: 100px;">
    <div class="property-intro">
      <div>
        <div class="property-kicker">Polaris property collection</div>
        <h1>Spaces with a sense of place.</h1>
        <p>Explore a considered collection of homes selected for their character, location, and long-term value.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="property-count"><%= houses.length %> residences currently available</div>
    </div>

    <div class="property-grid">
      <% houses.forEach((house) => { %>
      <article class="property-card">
        <a href="/real-estate-houses/<%= house.id %>">
          <div class="property-card-image">
            <img src="<%= house.images[0] %>" alt="<%= house.name %>">
            <span class="property-status"><%= house.status %></span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <div class="property-card-copy">
          <div class="property-type"><%= house.type %></div>
          <h2><%= house.name %></h2>
          <div class="property-location"><%= house.location %></div>
          <p><%= house.summary || house.description %></p>
          <div class="property-meta">
            <span><strong><%= house.bedrooms %></strong> beds</span>
            <span><strong><%= house.bathrooms %></strong> baths</span>
            <span><strong><%= house.area %></strong></span>
          </div>
          <div class="property-price"><%= formatMoney(house.price) %></div>
          <a class="property-link" href="/real-estate-houses/<%= house.id %>">View residence &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/landingPageFooter') %>